activity Accept Cargo
activity Examine Cargo
activity Document Cargo
activity Scan Cargo
activity Clear Cargo
activity Hold Cargo
activity Document Findings
activity Notify Authorities
activity Release Cargo
activity Archive Documentation
activity Dispatch Cargo
activity Log Entry
bind Accept Cargo: Cargo Identifier
bind Examine Cargo: Cargo Identifier, Inspector Identifier, Examination Result
bind Document Cargo: Cargo Identifier, Documentation State
bind Scan Cargo: Cargo Identifier, Cargo Weight
bind Clear Cargo: Cargo Identifier
bind Hold Cargo: Cargo Identifier
bind Document Findings: Cargo Identifier, Prohibited Item Found
bind Notify Authorities: Cargo Identifier, Prohibited Item Found, Notification State
bind Release Cargo: Cargo Identifier
bind Archive Documentation: Cargo Identifier, Documentation State
bind Dispatch Cargo: Cargo Identifier
bind Log Entry: Cargo Identifier
Cargo Identifier: integer between 1 and 999999
Cargo Weight: float between 0.1 and 10000
Inspector Identifier: integer between 1 and 9999
Examination Result: Clear, Hold
Prohibited Item Found: Yes, No
Notification State: Notified, Not Notified
Documentation State: Finished, Incomplete
Init[Log Entry] | |
Chain Precedence[Examine Cargo, Log Entry] | | |
Precedence[Document Cargo, Examine Cargo] | | |
Absence[Document Cargo] | |
Precedence[Clear Cargo, Scan Cargo] | | |
Chain Succession[Hold Cargo, Document Findings] | | |
Chain Response[Document Findings, Notify Authorities] | | |0,1,h
Response[Clear Cargo, Release Cargo] | | |
Existence[Release Cargo] | |
Chain Response[Release Cargo, Archive Documentation] | | |0,2,h
Response[Release Cargo, Dispatch Cargo] | | |
End[Dispatch Cargo] | |
Existence2[Clear Cargo] | |
Co-Existence[Scan Cargo, Examine Cargo] | | |
Precedence[Release Cargo, Notify Authorities] | | |